Chapter: MmioGateShut

 The refused half of the ARM64 MMIO window gate. Byte for byte the same read
 as `mmio-gate-open.codex` at the same address; the only difference is that
 this opening does not declare Device.Mmio, so slot 0 carries no cap-device
 and `a64-rt-guarded-access` answers -1 without touching the device.

 If this arm ever prints what the open arm prints, the gate is not there.

 We say:

Section: Body

  uart-fr : Integer = #9000018

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    v <- (peek-32 uart-fr 0)
    print-line-uni ("mmio: " & show v)
  end
